    skos:definition "Supplied normalized app session containing individually identified timed feature-use instances and optional instance-selection responses. Finesse (2021), published-layout p.8 Section3.3 and p.3 Figure1, stores session start/duration and each instance's feature name/start/end. Same-label instances are not one occurrence. IDs are supplied normalized identities, not recovered raw keys; no classification, session construction, sampling, timing conversion or regret computation runs during import." ;
    skos:inScheme <https://w3id.org/chronicle-usage-ontology/core> ;
