    skos:definition "Emit one symbol for every ordered occurrence. Emit the first symbol if this identity has not occurred earlier in the current partition and the repeat symbol otherwise, retaining every repeat and resetting history at each partition. Does not specify raw identity extraction or tie order. Jones DOI 10.1145/2750858.2807542, physical PDF p.6 (Bath cover=p.1)." ;
.

