    skos:definition "Zhu et al. (2018) source-aligned adapter: an immediately adjacent full-log screen-on then keyguard-hidden opens at unlock; screen-off or shutdown closes." ;
.

<https://w3id.org/chronicle-usage-ontology/core/ScreenSessionMaximumDurationDispositionId#exclude_participant>
