    rdfs:label "quantity_qualifier" ;
    rdfs:range xsd:string ;
    skos:definition "Supplied source-defined quantity variant: a core-residency frequency designation (Hush Section3.1), a session feature's absolute/frequency/normalization/state designation (Rabbit Hole Section4.1), or an explicitly named activity/component/connectivity/radio stratum for an Energy Drain2015 summary. No frequency, unit, weighting, group boundary or formula is inferred. Omission/null is unknown and does not merge members." ;
